+## Decisions & Alternatives
+
+| Decision | Chosen | Alternatives Considered | Rationale |
+|----------|--------|------------------------|-----------|
+| Lookup backend | Local embedded SQLite index | On-site HTTPS directory; Managed search service | Predictable offline lookups with no service to run; each kiosk validates and rebuilds its own index when a snapshot arrives, keeping all index maintenance inside the registry component. Meets tenet of no runtime network access and avoids recurring cost and external credentials. |
